  "name": "ecs",
  "description": "A performance-oriented, data-oriented entity component system designed for high-frequency entity lifecycle management and massive entity scaling. It utilizes a packed bit representation for entities to encode type metadata and employs a bucketed storage strategy to optimize component access and parallel processing. The architecture prioritizes serializability and memory-efficient indexing for billions of transient entities within addressable memory constraints.",
